  "historyNote": "#5934, eff 12-9-94, EXPIRED: 12-9-00 New. #7425, INTERIM, eff 1-13-01, EXPIRED: 7-12-01 New. #7549, eff 8-25-01; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
